cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: wahlwerk
abstract: >-
  A deterministic engine for German electoral and parliamentary systems, modelled as
  rules-as-code: an electoral law decomposes into six orthogonal, independently
  replaceable components, so that counterfactual variants of the law can be evaluated
  against real historical votes.
type: software
authors:
